# Build context exclusions for the images built from the REPOSITORY ROOT:
# `backend/src/JoiabagurPV.API/Dockerfile.bundled` (production) and
# `Dockerfile.demo` (C17). Both restore and build from source, so nothing
# excluded here is needed inside any stage.
#
# This file did not exist before C17 and the context was ~1 GB, virtually all
# of it thrown away by the daemon after the transfer: `node_modules` is
# reinstalled by `npm ci` in the frontend stage, `.venv` belongs to a service
# whose image is built from `ai-service/` (a different context), and `bin/`,
# `obj/` and `dist/` are outputs of the very stages that rebuild them.
#
# Note on scope: a `.dockerignore` applies to the context it sits at the root
# of. `ai-service/Dockerfile` is built with `ai-service/` as its context, so it
# is governed by `ai-service/.dockerignore`, not by this file.

# ─── Dependency trees, reinstalled inside the image ──────────────────────────
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/

# ─── Version control and tooling metadata ────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.agent/
.opencode/
.docs-update/
.pr/

# ─── Build outputs, produced by the stages that need them ────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
*.user

# ─── Local data and generated corpora, never part of an image ────────────────
data/
uploads/
**/uploads/
*.sql
*.dump
*.bak

# ─── Environment files. A secret inside an image is a secret with a passport ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.Development.json

# ─── Documentation and specifications, not shipped in a runtime image ────────
Documentos/
openspec/
*.md
!frontend/README.md
!ai-service/README.md

# ─── Infrastructure and deployment definitions ───────────────────────────────
terraform/
deploy/
compose.demo.yaml
docker-compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
!backend/src/JoiabagurPV.API/Dockerfile*
